  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f2c663a-0b90-4255-861c-99274da41c44"],
 " is constant, along a leftgoing ray the return arc length: radar \
coordinates are light-cone coordinates."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8d22e89a-45a6-42f3-b049-ae13bb4c4b2d"]
